    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a lively manuscript that tells the story of Athos as you embody him in his epic adventures. Athos' Code is a sword-fighting game that takes you to the heart of the quarrels of the French provinces in the 17th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.poster.avif?t=1744099122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.webm?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.mp4?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in Athos' rise to glory, embodying him in his most tragic skirmishes! Just like him, you'll have to master the rapier and show your agility to be the best swordsman. Break through your opponent's defenses or strike back after parrying!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box-by-box storytelling </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.poster.avif?t=1744099122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.webm?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.mp4?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the myth of Athos by navigating his book through a dynamic square-by-square narrative system punctuated by combat and story boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 levels </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/1c38984cd4b5631595792e1717b2ef79.poster.avif?t=1744099122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/1c38984cd4b5631595792e1717b2ef79.webm?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/1c38984cd4b5631595792e1717b2ef79.mp4?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong>    </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Athos' story through 5 levels, mixing humor, drama and battle. Pick up where you left off at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toggle-On Narration mode</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game's story without having to fight. Thanks to Narration mode, the story follows its own course, with you intervening only when crucial decisions are made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a lively manuscript that tells the story of Athos as you embody him in his epic adventures. Athos' Code is a sword-fighting game that takes you to the heart of the quarrels of the French provinces in the 17th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.poster.avif?t=1744099122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.webm?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/dae447074086f8d7851ed928100fd4f8.mp4?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in Athos' rise to glory, embodying him in his most tragic skirmishes! Just like him, you'll have to master the rapier and show your agility to be the best swordsman. Break through your opponent's defenses or strike back after parrying!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Box-by-box storytelling </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.poster.avif?t=1744099122\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.webm?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446910/extras/0fcb20a0bdafe056294e1dd54bc96ab6.mp4?t=1744099122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul